<title>USA: Teleflex Q1 net increases after gain.</title>
<headline>Teleflex Q1 net increases after gain.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH MEETING, Pa. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended		    Mar 30, 1997  Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p> Revenues				  $269,344,000  $234,448,000</p>
<p> Net income				  16,677,000    14,852,000</p>
<p> Earnings per share				 .90	  .83(A)</p>
<p> Average common shares outstanding   18,576,000    17,907,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income inncludes a pretax gain of $2 million, or $0.07 per share, on sale of divested product lines.</p>
</text>
